stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Home
  Home --> Diagnose: Diagnose a problem
  Diagnose --> Capturing: Start read-only session
  Capturing --> Report: Mark incident / finish
  Report --> Unknown: insufficient/conflicting evidence
  Report --> Guidance: documented Huawei policy likely
  Report --> Evidence: resource/thermal/I/O evidence available
  Unknown --> Diagnose: collect missing evidence
  Guidance --> Verify: user changes documented setting
  Verify --> Report: repeat observation
  Evidence --> Shadow: future policy evaluates candidate
  Shadow --> NoOp: not qualified / low expected value
  Shadow --> SafetyReview: qualified candidate exists
  SafetyReview --> Applied: explicit future typed canary
  SafetyReview --> NoOp: safety/rollback gate fails
  Applied --> Recovered: regression/failure -> rollback
  Applied --> Report: verified outcome
  Recovered --> Report
  NoOp --> Report
